	"description": {
		"ja": [
			"「機動戦士ガンダム」に登場する連邦軍の宇宙艦艇“マゼラン”と“サラミス”がセットでEXモデル化。両艦とも船体下部の脱出シャトルが脱着可能です。同スケールのジムとボールが各３機ずつ付属。サラミスにはボール専用ハンガーを装着可能。"
		],
		"en": [
			"The Federation spaceships \"Magellan\" and \"Salamis\" that appear in \"Mobile Suit Gundam\" have been made into an EXModel as a set. Both ships have removable escape shuttles at the bottom of the hull. Three gyms and balls of the same scale are included. A ball hanger can be attached to Salamis."
		]
